acceptance_criteria: "Interrupted arms use nullable child counts in typed results and native JSON/TOON; summaries preserve unknown totals and report unknown arm counts.; The public SDK parity runner skips clearly without fleet fixtures and README documents prerequisites.; One documented timeout scale preserves default regression limits, classifies timeouts explicitly, and keeps assertion failures immediate.; Behavioral revert proofs, targeted tests, typecheck and lint pass; npm and Bun CI release gates pass before handoff."
